What are the different ways `this` is bound? Predict the output.

```js
const obj = {
  name: 'Raj',
  a() { return this.name; },
  b: () => this?.name,
  c() { return [1].map(function () { return this?.name; }); },
  d() { return [1].map(() => this.name); }
};
console.log(obj.a(), obj.b(), obj.c(), obj.d());
```

